    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jeremiah finished speaking to all the people all these words of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their God, with which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " their God had sent him to them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azariah the son of Hoshaiah and Johanan the son of Kareah and all the insolent men said to Jeremiah, “You are telling a lie. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God did not send you to say, ‘Do not go to Egypt to live there’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but Baruch the son of Neriah has set you against us, to deliver us into the hand of the Chaldeans, that they may kill us or take us into exile in Babylon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Johanan the son of Kareah and all the commanders of the forces and all the people did not obey the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", to remain in the land of Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Johanan the son of Kareah and all the commanders of the forces took all the remnant of Judah who had returned to live in the land of Judah from all the nations to which they had been driven— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the men, the women, the children, the princesses, and every person whom Nebuzaradan the captain of the guard had left with Gedaliah the son of Ahikam, son of Shaphan; also Jeremiah the prophet and Baruch the son of Neriah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they came into the land of Egypt, for they did not obey the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". And they arrived at Tahpanhes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to Jeremiah in Tahpanhes: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Take in your hands large stones, and hide them in the mortar in the pavement which is at the entrance to Pharaoh's palace in Tahpanhes, in the sight of the men of Judah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and say to them, ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, the God of Israel: Behold, I will send and take Nebuchadrezzar the king of Babylon, my servant, and he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " will set his throne above these stones which I have hid, and he will spread his royal canopy over them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall come and smite the land of Egypt, giving to the pestilence those who are doomed to the pestilence, to captivity those who are doomed to captivity, and to the sword those who are doomed to the sword. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " shall kindle a fire in the temples of the gods of Egypt; and he shall burn them and carry them away captive; and he shall clean the land of Egypt, as a shepherd cleans his cloak of vermin; and he shall go away from there in peace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall break the obelisks of Heliopolis which is in the land of Egypt; and the temples of the gods of Egypt he shall burn with fire.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
